### unset of an unquoted literal index
unset hosts[1]
>>> SC2184 1:7

### unset of an unquoted variable index
unset hosts[$i]
>>> SC2086 1:13
>>> SC2154 1:13
>>> SC2184 1:7

### unset of an index mixing text and an expansion
unset hosts[x${i}y]
>>> SC2086 1:14
>>> SC2154 1:14
>>> SC2184 1:7

### unset of a plain name
unset hosts
>>> none

### reversed brackets are not a range
unset hosts][
>>> none
